    <div class="grid-2">
      <div>
        <div class="gold-block">
          <h3>What Actually Happened on October 22, 1844</h3>
          <p>&ldquo;At the end of the 2300 days, in 1844, our great High Priest entered the most holy place of the heavenly sanctuary, to perform the closing work of atonement preparatory to His coming.&rdquo;</p>
