        </div>
        <div class="gold-block">
          <p>&ldquo;In 1844, at the close of the prophetic period of 2300 days, Christ entered upon the closing work of His ministry. He then began His ministration in the second apartment of the heavenly sanctuary, in the presence of God, to make atonement for all who are shown to be entitled to its benefit.&rdquo;</p>
